    <briefdescription>
<para>Mutable view of a complex number as a pair of <computeroutput>mpfr_ptr</computeroutput> real and imaginary parts. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Companion to <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_c_c__struct" kindref="compound">CC_struct</ref></computeroutput>: the <computeroutput>mpfr_ptr</computeroutput> members allow in-place MPFR arithmetic. The commented-out <computeroutput><ref refid="m2-types_8h_a4c94265a164e162d16914f55bb94902c_1a4c94265a164e162d16914f55bb94902c" kindref="member">gmp_CCmutable</ref></computeroutput> / <computeroutput><ref refid="m2-types_8h_a18e5439d68407cce7cf8b4433a93f091_1a18e5439d68407cce7cf8b4433a93f091" kindref="member">gmp_CC</ref></computeroutput> typedefs below show how engine pointers used to alias these structs before the macro-based layout in <computeroutput><ref refid="m2-types_8h" kindref="compound">m2-types.h</ref></computeroutput> replaced them. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
